{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_minh_su_103_1","chapterId":"ch_work_minh_su_103","textTraditional":"諸王世表四","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_minh_su_103_2","chapterId":"ch_work_minh_su_103","textTraditional":"建文初，封弟允熥為吳王，允熞為衡王，允熙為徐王，皆懿文太子子也。福王時，追諡吳王曰悼，衡王曰愍，徐王曰哀，見福王傳。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_minh_su_103_3","chapterId":"ch_work_minh_su_103","textTraditional":"悼王允熥，懿文太子嫡三子，建文元年封，未就藩。成祖入京師，降封廣澤王，居漳州。其年九月召還，廢為庶人。永樂十五年卒。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_minh_su_103_4","chapterId":"ch_work_minh_su_103","textTraditional":"愍王允熞，懿文太子庶四子，建文元年封，未就藩。成祖入京師，降封懷恩王，居建昌。其年，與吳王俱召還，廢為庶人。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_minh_su_103_5","chapterId":"ch_work_minh_su_103","textTraditional":"哀簡王允熙，懿文太子庶五子，建文元年封，未就藩。成祖入京師，降封敷惠王，隨母居太子陵。永樂二年改封甌寧王，奉懿文祀。四年卒。無子，除。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_minh_su_103_6","chapterId":"ch_work_minh_su_103","textTraditional":"成祖四子。仁宗外，高爔未封。其得封者二王，曰漢王高煦，曰趙簡王高燧。","sentenceOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_minh_su_103_7","chapterId":"ch_work_minh_su_103","textTraditional":"高煦，成祖嫡二子。洪武二十八年封高陽王，永樂二年進封。十五年就藩樂安州。宣德元年八月反，削爵錮西內，焚死。世子瞻坦先卒。韋妃及九子俱從死，除。","sentenceOrder":7},{"id":"s_work_minh_su_103_8","chapterId":"ch_work_minh_su_103","textTraditional":"簡王高燧，成祖嫡三子，永樂二年封。洪熙元年就藩彰德府。宣德六年薨。世子瞻坺先卒。","sentenceOrder":8},{"id":"s_work_minh_su_103_9","chapterId":"ch_work_minh_su_103","textTraditional":"惠王瞻塙，簡嫡二子，初封安陽王，宣德七年襲封。景泰五年薨。","sentenceOrder":9},{"id":"s_work_minh_su_103_10","chapterId":"ch_work_minh_su_103","textTraditional":"悼王祁鎡，惠嫡一子，景泰六年，襲封。天順四年薨。","sentenceOrder":10},{"id":"s_work_minh_su_103_11","chapterId":"ch_work_minh_su_103","textTraditional":"靖王見灂，悼庶一子，成化元年襲封。弘治十五年薨。","sentenceOrder":11},{"id":"s_work_minh_su_103_12","chapterId":"ch_work_minh_su_103","textTraditional":"莊王祐棌，靖庶三子，初封清流王，弘治十六年襲封。正德十三年薨。","sentenceOrder":12},{"id":"s_work_minh_su_103_13","chapterId":"ch_work_minh_su_103","textTraditional":"康王厚煜，莊嫡一子，正德十六年襲封。嘉靖三十九年薨。","sentenceOrder":13},{"id":"s_work_minh_su_103_14","chapterId":"ch_work_minh_su_103","textTraditional":"載培，康庶一子，初封獲嘉王。嘉靖十六年薨，諡昭定。後以孫常清襲趙封，進封親王，改諡曰恭。","sentenceOrder":14},{"id":"s_work_minh_su_103_15","chapterId":"ch_work_minh_su_103","textTraditional":"翊錙，恭嫡一子，嘉靖二十八年封世孫。三十八年薨。以子常清襲封。追封王，諡曰安。","sentenceOrder":15},{"id":"s_work_minh_su_103_16","chapterId":"ch_work_minh_su_103","textTraditional":"穆王常清，安嫡一子，嘉靖四十四年襲封。萬曆四十二年薨。","sentenceOrder":16},{"id":"s_work_minh_su_103_17","chapterId":"ch_work_minh_su_103","textTraditional":"由松，穆嫡一子，萬曆十三年封世子。四十二年未襲薨。無子。","sentenceOrder":17},{"id":"s_work_minh_su_103_18","chapterId":"ch_work_minh_su_103","textTraditional":"□王慈〈忄翰，羽改火〉，壽光王由桂嫡一子，萬曆中改封世孫。四十五年嗣封。","sentenceOrder":18},{"id":"s_work_minh_su_103_19","chapterId":"ch_work_minh_su_103","textTraditional":"臨漳","sentenceOrder":19},{"id":"s_work_minh_su_103_20","chapterId":"ch_work_minh_su_103","textTraditional":"恭安王祁鋆，惠嫡二子，正統九年封。成化二十一年薨。","sentenceOrder":20},{"id":"s_work_minh_su_103_21","chapterId":"ch_work_minh_su_103","textTraditional":"榮和王見淔，恭安嫡一子，成化二十三年襲封。正德十一年薨。","sentenceOrder":21},{"id":"s_work_minh_su_103_22","chapterId":"ch_work_minh_su_103","textTraditional":"祐杙，榮和庶一子，成化二十三年封鎮國將軍。弘治十八年卒。以子厚炣襲封，追封王，諡悼懷。","sentenceOrder":22},{"id":"s_work_minh_su_103_23","chapterId":"ch_work_minh_su_103","textTraditional":"康端王厚炣，悼懷庶一子，正德十六年襲封。嘉靖八年薨。","sentenceOrder":23},{"id":"s_work_minh_su_103_24","chapterId":"ch_work_minh_su_103","textTraditional":"莊惠王載〈土兹〉，康端庶一子，嘉靖十七年襲封。萬曆十八年薨。","sentenceOrder":24},{"id":"s_work_minh_su_103_25","chapterId":"ch_work_minh_su_103","textTraditional":"□□王翊鎙，莊惠庶一子，萬曆十四年封長子。二十一年襲封，薨。","sentenceOrder":25},{"id":"s_work_minh_su_103_26","chapterId":"ch_work_minh_su_103","textTraditional":"□□王常海，翊鎙嫡一子，萬曆二十七年封長子。天啟二年襲封。","sentenceOrder":26},{"id":"s_work_minh_su_103_27","chapterId":"ch_work_minh_su_103","textTraditional":"湯陰","sentenceOrder":27},{"id":"s_work_minh_su_103_28","chapterId":"ch_work_minh_su_103","textTraditional":"莊僖王祁〈金芮〉，惠嫡三子，正統九年封。成化二十一年薨。","sentenceOrder":28},{"id":"s_work_minh_su_103_29","chapterId":"ch_work_minh_su_103","textTraditional":"見準，莊僖嫡一子，成化二十一年襲封。弘治六年以罪賜死，除。","sentenceOrder":29},{"id":"s_work_minh_su_103_30","chapterId":"ch_work_minh_su_103","textTraditional":"襄邑","sentenceOrder":30},{"id":"s_work_minh_su_103_31","chapterId":"ch_work_minh_su_103","textTraditional":"恭定王祁鋥，惠嫡四子，正統九年封。成化元年薨。","sentenceOrder":31},{"id":"s_work_minh_su_103_32","chapterId":"ch_work_minh_su_103","textTraditional":"懷簡王見滃，恭定嫡一子，成化四年襲封。十二年薨。無子。","sentenceOrder":32},{"id":"s_work_minh_su_103_33","chapterId":"ch_work_minh_su_103","textTraditional":"榮惠王見沂，恭定庶二子，成化十三年進封。弘治六年薨。","sentenceOrder":33},{"id":"s_work_minh_su_103_34","chapterId":"ch_work_minh_su_103","textTraditional":"昭和王祐櫸，榮惠庶一子，弘治七年襲封。正德十一年薨。","sentenceOrder":34},{"id":"s_work_minh_su_103_35","chapterId":"ch_work_minh_su_103","textTraditional":"端順王厚燔，昭和庶一子，嘉靖三十八年襲封。萬曆十一年薨。子翊釤擅婚，例不准襲，除。","sentenceOrder":35},{"id":"s_work_minh_su_103_36","chapterId":"ch_work_minh_su_103","textTraditional":"洛川","sentenceOrder":36},{"id":"s_work_minh_su_103_37","chapterId":"ch_work_minh_su_103","textTraditional":"靖懿王祁鋹，惠嫡五子，正統十年封。成化十九年薨。","sentenceOrder":37},{"id":"s_work_minh_su_103_38","chapterId":"ch_work_minh_su_103","textTraditional":"榮恪王見渥，靖懿嫡一子，成化二十年襲封。正德十二年薨。","sentenceOrder":38},{"id":"s_work_minh_su_103_39","chapterId":"ch_work_minh_su_103","textTraditional":"康定王祐架，榮恪庶一子，嘉靖元年襲封。十九年薨。","sentenceOrder":39},{"id":"s_work_minh_su_103_40","chapterId":"ch_work_minh_su_103","textTraditional":"厚焀，康定嫡一子，正德十四年封長子。嘉靖八年卒。以子載墝襲封。追封王，諡懷順。","sentenceOrder":40},{"id":"s_work_minh_su_103_41","chapterId":"ch_work_minh_su_103","textTraditional":"恭簡王載墝，懷順嫡一子，嘉靖二十三年襲封。三十三年薨。","sentenceOrder":41},{"id":"s_work_minh_su_103_42","chapterId":"ch_work_minh_su_103","textTraditional":"莊憲王翊鏴，恭簡嫡一子，嘉靖三十八年襲封。四十四年薨。","sentenceOrder":42},{"id":"s_work_minh_su_103_43","chapterId":"ch_work_minh_su_103","textTraditional":"端惠王常渲，莊憲嫡一子，萬曆元年襲封。三十二年薨。","sentenceOrder":43},{"id":"s_work_minh_su_103_44","chapterId":"ch_work_minh_su_103","textTraditional":"□□王由〈石利〉，端惠嫡一子，萬曆二十一年封長子。三十六年襲封，薨。","sentenceOrder":44},{"id":"s_work_minh_su_103_45","chapterId":"ch_work_minh_su_103","textTraditional":"□□王慈〈焜，比改匕〉，由〈石利〉嫡一子，天啟三年襲封。","sentenceOrder":45},{"id":"s_work_minh_su_103_46","chapterId":"ch_work_minh_su_103","textTraditional":"南樂","sentenceOrder":46},{"id":"s_work_minh_su_103_47","chapterId":"ch_work_minh_su_103","textTraditional":"安懿王祁鉷，惠嫡七子，天順元年封。弘治十六年薨。","sentenceOrder":47},{"id":"s_work_minh_su_103_48","chapterId":"ch_work_minh_su_103","textTraditional":"榮僖王見瀾，安懿庶一子，正德十一年襲封。嘉靖元年薨。","sentenceOrder":48},{"id":"s_work_minh_su_103_49","chapterId":"ch_work_minh_su_103","textTraditional":"宣靖王祐檟，榮僖庶一子，嘉靖四年襲封。十八年薨。","sentenceOrder":49},{"id":"s_work_minh_su_103_50","chapterId":"ch_work_minh_su_103","textTraditional":"康順王厚〈火{刀田}〉，宣靖嫡一子，嘉靖二十二年襲封。萬曆八年薨。","sentenceOrder":50},{"id":"s_work_minh_su_103_51","chapterId":"ch_work_minh_su_103","textTraditional":"恭恪王載墲，康順庶一子，萬曆十二年襲封。十三年薨。","sentenceOrder":51},{"id":"s_work_minh_su_103_52","chapterId":"ch_work_minh_su_103","textTraditional":"□□王翊〈金离〉，恭恪庶一子，萬曆十六年襲封，薨。","sentenceOrder":52},{"id":"s_work_minh_su_103_53","chapterId":"ch_work_minh_su_103","textTraditional":"□□王常汰，翊〈金离〉嫡一子，萬曆三十年封長子，旣而襲封。","sentenceOrder":53},{"id":"s_work_minh_su_103_54","chapterId":"ch_work_minh_su_103","textTraditional":"平鄉","sentenceOrder":54},{"id":"s_work_minh_su_103_55","chapterId":"ch_work_minh_su_103","textTraditional":"榮順王祁鏓，惠庶八子，天順元年封。成化十二年薨。","sentenceOrder":55},{"id":"s_work_minh_su_103_56","chapterId":"ch_work_minh_su_103","textTraditional":"榮康王見洸，榮順庶一子，弘治元年襲封。嘉靖七年薨。","sentenceOrder":56},{"id":"s_work_minh_su_103_57","chapterId":"ch_work_minh_su_103","textTraditional":"祐楸，榮康庶一子，正德三年封鎮國將軍。八年卒。以子厚燝襲封。追封王，諡僖穆。","sentenceOrder":57},{"id":"s_work_minh_su_103_58","chapterId":"ch_work_minh_su_103","textTraditional":"恭和王厚燝，僖穆嫡一子，嘉靖十二年襲封。萬曆四年薨。","sentenceOrder":58},{"id":"s_work_minh_su_103_59","chapterId":"ch_work_minh_su_103","textTraditional":"安莊王載坋，恭和庶一子，萬曆四年以鎮國將軍襲封。十一年罪革，半祿，子孫降封奉祀，除。","sentenceOrder":59},{"id":"s_work_minh_su_103_60","chapterId":"ch_work_minh_su_103","textTraditional":"汝源","sentenceOrder":60},{"id":"s_work_minh_su_103_61","chapterId":"ch_work_minh_su_103","textTraditional":"榮昭王見淇，悼庶二子，成化三年封。嘉靖八年薨。","sentenceOrder":61},{"id":"s_work_minh_su_103_62","chapterId":"ch_work_minh_su_103","textTraditional":"祐桐，榮昭嫡一子，成化十九年封長子。嘉靖七年卒。以子厚焆襲封，追封王，諡懷和。","sentenceOrder":62},{"id":"s_work_minh_su_103_63","chapterId":"ch_work_minh_su_103","textTraditional":"端僖王厚焆，懷和庶一子，嘉靖十年襲封。二十八年薨。","sentenceOrder":63},{"id":"s_work_minh_su_103_64","chapterId":"ch_work_minh_su_103","textTraditional":"載〈土量〉，端僖嫡一子，未襲卒。無子，除。","sentenceOrder":64},{"id":"s_work_minh_su_103_65","chapterId":"ch_work_minh_su_103","textTraditional":"昆陽","sentenceOrder":65},{"id":"s_work_minh_su_103_66","chapterId":"ch_work_minh_su_103","textTraditional":"溫穆王見洽，悼庶三子，成化三年封。正德元年薨。無子，除。","sentenceOrder":66},{"id":"s_work_minh_su_103_67","chapterId":"ch_work_minh_su_103","textTraditional":"廣安","sentenceOrder":67},{"id":"s_work_minh_su_103_68","chapterId":"ch_work_minh_su_103","textTraditional":"端裕王祐枳，靖庶五子，弘治五年封。十五年薨。","sentenceOrder":68},{"id":"s_work_minh_su_103_69","chapterId":"ch_work_minh_su_103","textTraditional":"溫懿王厚熽，端裕嫡一子，正德十年襲封。嘉靖三十五年薨。","sentenceOrder":69},{"id":"s_work_minh_su_103_70","chapterId":"ch_work_minh_su_103","textTraditional":"康裕王載堂，溫懿嫡一子，嘉靖三十八年襲封。隆慶五年薨。","sentenceOrder":70},{"id":"s_work_minh_su_103_71","chapterId":"ch_work_minh_su_103","textTraditional":"□□王翊鎀，康裕嫡一子，萬曆二年襲封。三十四年薨。","sentenceOrder":71},{"id":"s_work_minh_su_103_72","chapterId":"ch_work_minh_su_103","textTraditional":"江寧","sentenceOrder":72},{"id":"s_work_minh_su_103_73","chapterId":"ch_work_minh_su_103","textTraditional":"恭懿王厚煉，莊庶三子，正德十六年封。嘉靖四十一年薨。","sentenceOrder":73},{"id":"s_work_minh_su_103_74","chapterId":"ch_work_minh_su_103","textTraditional":"莊惠王載墣，恭懿嫡一子，嘉靖四十四年襲封。萬曆九年薨。","sentenceOrder":74},{"id":"s_work_minh_su_103_75","chapterId":"ch_work_minh_su_103","textTraditional":"□□王翊〈金否〉，莊惠庶一子，萬曆十二年襲封。二十八年薨。一子常淰，先卒。無嗣，除。","sentenceOrder":75},{"id":"s_work_minh_su_103_76","chapterId":"ch_work_minh_su_103","textTraditional":"光山","sentenceOrder":76},{"id":"s_work_minh_su_103_77","chapterId":"ch_work_minh_su_103","textTraditional":"康靖王厚煇，莊庶四子，嘉靖二年封。三十年薨。一子殀，除。","sentenceOrder":77},{"id":"s_work_minh_su_103_78","chapterId":"ch_work_minh_su_103","textTraditional":"秀水","sentenceOrder":78},{"id":"s_work_minh_su_103_79","chapterId":"ch_work_minh_su_103","textTraditional":"憲穆王厚炯，莊庶六子，嘉靖九年封。十九年薨。一子殀，除。","sentenceOrder":79},{"id":"s_work_minh_su_103_80","chapterId":"ch_work_minh_su_103","textTraditional":"成皐","sentenceOrder":80},{"id":"s_work_minh_su_103_81","chapterId":"ch_work_minh_su_103","textTraditional":"端穆王載垸，康庶四子，嘉靖十九年封。萬曆十二年薨。","sentenceOrder":81},{"id":"s_work_minh_su_103_82","chapterId":"ch_work_minh_su_103","textTraditional":"翊錝，端穆庶一子，嘉靖三十六年封鎮國將軍。萬曆五年卒。以子常〈氵臾〉襲封，追封王，諡昭裕。","sentenceOrder":82},{"id":"s_work_minh_su_103_83","chapterId":"ch_work_minh_su_103","textTraditional":"□□王常〈氵臾〉，昭裕庶一子，萬曆十五年襲封，薨。","sentenceOrder":83},{"id":"s_work_minh_su_103_84","chapterId":"ch_work_minh_su_103","textTraditional":"□□王由朴，常〈氵臾〉嫡一子，萬曆二十九年封長子，旣而襲封，薨。","sentenceOrder":84},{"id":"s_work_minh_su_103_85","chapterId":"ch_work_minh_su_103","textTraditional":"壽光","sentenceOrder":85},{"id":"s_work_minh_su_103_86","chapterId":"ch_work_minh_su_103","textTraditional":"□□王由桂，穆庶七子，萬曆二十七年封。三十六年薨。後子慈〈忄翰，羽改火〉嗣趙封，郡爵例不襲。","sentenceOrder":86},{"id":"s_work_minh_su_103_87","chapterId":"ch_work_minh_su_103","textTraditional":"仁宗十子。宣宗外，瞻垠未封。其得封者八王，曰鄭靖王瞻埈，曰越靖王瞻墉，曰襄憲王瞻墡，曰荊憲王瞻堈，曰淮靖王瞻墺，曰滕懷王瞻塏，曰梁莊王瞻垍，曰衞恭王瞻埏。","sentenceOrder":87},{"id":"s_work_minh_su_103_88","chapterId":"ch_work_minh_su_103","textTraditional":"靖王瞻埈，仁宗庶二子，永樂二十二年封。宣德四年就藩鳳翔府。正統九年移懷慶府。成化二年薨。","sentenceOrder":88},{"id":"s_work_minh_su_103_89","chapterId":"ch_work_minh_su_103","textTraditional":"簡王祁鍈，靖嫡一子，成化四年襲封。弘治八年薨。","sentenceOrder":89},{"id":"s_work_minh_su_103_90","chapterId":"ch_work_minh_su_103","textTraditional":"見滋，簡嫡一子，成化七年封世子。十五年薨。以子祐枔襲封。追封王，諡曰僖。","sentenceOrder":90},{"id":"s_work_minh_su_103_91","chapterId":"ch_work_minh_su_103","textTraditional":"康王祐枔，僖嫡一子，弘治十四年襲封。正德二年薨。無子，從弟祐檡立。","sentenceOrder":91},{"id":"s_work_minh_su_103_92","chapterId":"ch_work_minh_su_103","textTraditional":"懿王祐檡，東垣端惠王嫡一子，初襲東垣王，正德四年嗣封。十六年薨。","sentenceOrder":92},{"id":"s_work_minh_su_103_93","chapterId":"ch_work_minh_su_103","textTraditional":"恭王厚烷，懿嫡四子，嘉靖六年襲封。二十九年以諫帝真修，降庶人，發高牆。隆慶元年復爵，加祿四百石。萬曆十九年薨。","sentenceOrder":93},{"id":"s_work_minh_su_103_94","chapterId":"ch_work_minh_su_103","textTraditional":"端清世子載堉，恭嫡一子，嘉靖二十五年封世子。萬曆三十三年讓爵載壐。詔載堉及子翊錫，准以世子、世孫祿終身。其子孫仍封東垣王，以接見〈氵貢〉之統。","sentenceOrder":94},{"id":"s_work_minh_su_103_95","chapterId":"ch_work_minh_su_103","textTraditional":"□王載壐，恭再從弟庶人厚煒嫡一子，盟津王見濍曾孫也。以載堉讓爵，萬曆三十四年受封，薨。","sentenceOrder":95},{"id":"s_work_minh_su_103_96","chapterId":"ch_work_minh_su_103","textTraditional":"□王翊鐘，載壐嫡一子，萬曆三十五年封世子，旣而襲封。崇禎十三年以罪賜死，除。","sentenceOrder":96},{"id":"s_work_minh_su_103_97","chapterId":"ch_work_minh_su_103","textTraditional":"新平","sentenceOrder":97},{"id":"s_work_minh_su_103_98","chapterId":"ch_work_minh_su_103","textTraditional":"懷僖王祁銳，靖嫡二子，正統七年封。景泰七年薨。無子，除。","sentenceOrder":98},{"id":"s_work_minh_su_103_99","chapterId":"ch_work_minh_su_103","textTraditional":"涇陽","sentenceOrder":99},{"id":"s_work_minh_su_103_100","chapterId":"ch_work_minh_su_103","textTraditional":"安靖王祁銑，靖庶三子，正統八年封。弘治元年薨。","sentenceOrder":100},{"id":"s_work_minh_su_103_101","chapterId":"ch_work_minh_su_103","textTraditional":"見溢，安靖嫡一子，弘治四年襲封。八年革爵。十六年卒。無子，除。","sentenceOrder":101},{"id":"s_work_minh_su_103_102","chapterId":"ch_work_minh_su_103","textTraditional":"朝邑","sentenceOrder":102},{"id":"s_work_minh_su_103_103","chapterId":"ch_work_minh_su_103","textTraditional":"榮簡王祁鎔，靖嫡四子，正統八年封。成化二十二年薨。無子，除。","sentenceOrder":103},{"id":"s_work_minh_su_103_104","chapterId":"ch_work_minh_su_103","textTraditional":"盟津","sentenceOrder":104},{"id":"s_work_minh_su_103_105","chapterId":"ch_work_minh_su_103","textTraditional":"見濍，簡庶三子，成化十年封。二十年，罪降庶人，發高牆。弘治元年釋回。四年卒。子孫俱庶人。","sentenceOrder":105},{"id":"s_work_minh_su_103_106","chapterId":"ch_work_minh_su_103","textTraditional":"祐橏，見濍嫡一子。","sentenceOrder":106},{"id":"s_work_minh_su_103_107","chapterId":"ch_work_minh_su_103","textTraditional":"厚煒，祐橏嫡一子。","sentenceOrder":107},{"id":"s_work_minh_su_103_108","chapterId":"ch_work_minh_su_103","textTraditional":"載壐，嗣鄭封，見前。","sentenceOrder":108},{"id":"s_work_minh_su_103_109","chapterId":"ch_work_minh_su_103","textTraditional":"東垣","sentenceOrder":109},{"id":"s_work_minh_su_103_110","chapterId":"ch_work_minh_su_103","textTraditional":"端惠王見〈氵貢〉，簡庶四子，成化十年封。弘治十六年薨。","sentenceOrder":110},{"id":"s_work_minh_su_103_111","chapterId":"ch_work_minh_su_103","textTraditional":"祐檡，嗣鄭封，見前。","sentenceOrder":111},{"id":"s_work_minh_su_103_112","chapterId":"ch_work_minh_su_103","textTraditional":"榮昭王厚炯，懿庶二子，正德十二年仍准襲郡封。嘉靖三十八年薨。","sentenceOrder":112},{"id":"s_work_minh_su_103_113","chapterId":"ch_work_minh_su_103","textTraditional":"康僖王載墽，榮昭嫡一子，嘉靖四十二年襲封。萬曆十一年薨。","sentenceOrder":113},{"id":"s_work_minh_su_103_114","chapterId":"ch_work_minh_su_103","textTraditional":"恭懿王翊鎧，康僖□一子，萬曆中襲封，薨。","sentenceOrder":114},{"id":"s_work_minh_su_103_115","chapterId":"ch_work_minh_su_103","textTraditional":"□□王常〈渃，右改夆〉，恭懿嫡一子，萬曆二十五年以鎮國將軍改封長子。三十七年襲封。四十二年薨。","sentenceOrder":115},{"id":"s_work_minh_su_103_116","chapterId":"ch_work_minh_su_103","textTraditional":"□□王由彬，常〈渃，右改夆〉嫡一子，萬曆三十八年封長子。四十六年襲封。崇禎八年薨。世子載堉孫常潔立。","sentenceOrder":116},{"id":"s_work_minh_su_103_117","chapterId":"ch_work_minh_su_103","textTraditional":"□□王常潔，端清次子翊鈦嫡一子，初封輔國將軍，以萬曆中詔仍封東垣。崇禎八年，值東垣王由彬薨，遂襲封。","sentenceOrder":117},{"id":"s_work_minh_su_103_118","chapterId":"ch_work_minh_su_103","textTraditional":"河陽","sentenceOrder":118},{"id":"s_work_minh_su_103_119","chapterId":"ch_work_minh_su_103","textTraditional":"懷簡王見溈，簡庶五子，成化十二年封。十五年薨。無子，除。","sentenceOrder":119},{"id":"s_work_minh_su_103_120","chapterId":"ch_work_minh_su_103","textTraditional":"信陽","sentenceOrder":120},{"id":"s_work_minh_su_103_121","chapterId":"ch_work_minh_su_103","textTraditional":"悼懷王見泿，簡庶七子，成化十七年封。十八年薨。無子，除。","sentenceOrder":1