nceOrder":137},{"id":"s_work_minh_su_103_138","chapterId":"ch_work_minh_su_103","textTraditional":"德慶","sentenceOrder":138},{"id":"s_work_minh_su_103_139","chapterId":"ch_work_minh_su_103","textTraditional":"恭惠王載堼，恭庶二子，嘉靖三十年封。萬曆十六年薨。","sentenceOrder":139},{"id":"s_work_minh_su_103_140","chapterId":"ch_work_minh_su_103","textTraditional":"□□王翊〈金耎〉，恭惠嫡一子，萬曆中襲封，薨。無子，除。","sentenceOrder":140},{"id":"s_work_minh_su_103_141","chapterId":"ch_work_minh_su_103","textTraditional":"崇德","sentenceOrder":141},{"id":"s_work_minh_su_103_142","chapterId":"ch_work_minh_su_103","textTraditional":"恭簡王載陞，恭庶四子，隆慶二年封。五年薨。無子，除。","sentenceOrder":142},{"id":"s_work_minh_su_103_143","chapterId":"ch_work_minh_su_103","textTraditional":"靖王瞻墉，仁宗嫡三子，永樂二十二年封，建邸衢州府，未行。正統四年薨。無子，除。","sentenceOrder":143},{"id":"s_work_minh_su_103_144","chapterId":"ch_work_minh_su_103","textTraditional":"憲王瞻墡，仁宗嫡五子，永樂二十二年封。宣德四年就藩長沙府。正統元年移襄陽府。成化十四年薨。","sentenceOrder":144},{"id":"s_work_minh_su_103_145","chapterId":"ch_work_minh_su_103","textTraditional":"定王祁鏞，憲嫡一子，成化十五年襲封。弘治元年薨。","sentenceOrder":145},{"id":"s_work_minh_su_103_146","chapterId":"ch_work_minh_su_103","textTraditional":"簡王見淑，定庶一子，弘治二年襲封。三年薨。","sentenceOrder":146},{"id":"s_work_minh_su_103_147","chapterId":"ch_work_minh_su_103","textTraditional":"懷王祐材，簡庶一子，弘治四年襲封。十七年薨。無子。","sentenceOrder":147},{"id":"s_work_minh_su_103_148","chapterId":"ch_work_minh_su_103","textTraditional":"莊王厚熲，陽山王祐楬庶一子，初襲陽山王，嘉靖三十一年嗣封。追諡其祖見淓為恭王，父為惠王。四十五年薨。","sentenceOrder":148},{"id":"s_work_minh_su_103_149","chapterId":"ch_work_minh_su_103","textTraditional":"靖王載堯，莊庶一子，初封安福王，隆慶三年襲封。萬曆二十三年薨。郡爵例不襲。","sentenceOrder":149},{"id":"s_work_minh_su_103_150","chapterId":"ch_work_minh_su_103","textTraditional":"忠王翊銘，靖庶一子，萬曆二十九年襲封。崇禎十四年，張獻忠陷襄陽，遇害。","sentenceOrder":150},{"id":"s_work_minh_su_103_151","chapterId":"ch_work_minh_su_103","textTraditional":"□王常澄，翊銘嫡二子，初封福清王，崇禎十七年進封。寄居九江府。","sentenceOrder":151},{"id":"s_work_minh_su_103_152","chapterId":"ch_work_minh_su_103","textTraditional":"康王祐櫍，簡庶二子，初封光